# Sauron Project Development Environment

```dec-studio

@freeze(
    "Read and Write file with UTF8 for all text files under Windows, NO BOM.",
    "Read-Method, like `Get-Content` MUST and FORCE to use UTF-8 !!!"
) !important !mandatory

@toolchains(
    "D:/ProgramFiles/ToolChains/",
    include = [ gcc, git, go, jdk, nodejs, python, protoc, ...etc ]
)

@toolchains(
    "D:/ProgramFiles/JetBrains/IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.2/plugins/maven/lib/maven3/bin/mvn.cmd",
    include = [ maven ]
)


@deprecated(
    "Global `PATH` variable is deprecated, due to multiple toolchain versions."
)

@taboo(
    "Global `PATH` variable is strictly prohibited to modify."
)

```
